merges. Each command's scope is named, because a figure whose scope is unstated
is the defect several of these iterations were about.

  api tests            203 passed, 1 skipped   (uv run --directory src/api pytest)
                       The skip is model_invocation — E008 owns that table.
                       Includes the 3 benchmark tests: the marker is
                       deselectable, not deselected by default. Without them:
                       200 passed, 1 skipped, 3 deselected.
